cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Mariana in your work, please cite this repository."
type: software
title: "Mariana: One-stop Research and Development Studio for language models"
abstract: >-
  Mariana is a one-stop research and development studio for language models:
  a byte-level hybrid diffusion-autoregressive model with single-command
  training, generation, and lossless AR export, plus a local Studio for
  training, chat, agents, and deployment. The repository includes whitepapers
  for Sprint-DRV, SAINT, AXIOM, Next-Concept Modeling, and the AML/AMP agent
  language and protocol.
authors:
  - name: "Mariana contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/CYFARE/Mariana"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
version: "2.3.3"
keywords:
  - language-model
  - diffusion
  - autoregressive
  - byte-level
  - pytorch
  - agents
  - aml
  - amp
